  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Grace. You're verified. I found order K-9201 from Green Bowl. It was handed to you at 6:40 PM, so you're well within the window to report missing items.\n\n**First, a quick question:** your order had **2 lemonades**. Was one missing or both?\n\n**Your options for each missing item:** Your order used the promo code FALL15 ($15 off), so a card refund for an item is the item's price minus its share of that discount. You'd get that share back as Forkful credit instead.\n\n**Grain bowl ($18.00):**\n- **Refund to card:** $13.50 to your Visa ending 4242, plus $4.50 in account credit, **or**\n- **Account credit:** $21.60 (the item's price plus 20%)\n\n**Lemonade ($4.00 each):**\n- **Refund to card:** $3.00 to your card plus $1.00 in credit per lemonade, **or**\n- **Account credit:** $4.80 per lemonade\n\n**One limit to know about:** I can give up to $25 in account credit per conversation. If you choose credit for the grain bowl ($21.60), I'd have to refund the lemonade to your card instead, since credit for it would go over $25.\n\nPlease tell me how many lemonades were missing and whether you'd like a refund or credit, and I'll take care of it right away."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "One lemonade was missing, not both. The grain bowl and that one lemonade are what's missing.\n\nFor the grain bowl, I'd like account credit since I order there a lot. For the lemonade, I'd like the money back on my card."
  },
