  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've sorted out both items:\n\n- **Grain bowl:** $21.60 has been added to your Forkful account (the $18.00 price plus 20%).\n- **Lemonade:** $3.00 is going back to your Visa ending 4242 and should show up in 3\u20135 business days. The other $1.00 is the lemonade's share of the FALL15 discount, so it's been added to your account.\n\nYour account balance is now **$22.60**, and it will apply to your next order, maybe your next Green Bowl order.\n\nYou may also see a $55.49 pending hold from when you placed the order. That's not a second charge. It was released when the real charge went through and should drop off your statement in 1\u20133 business days.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks. Just to check the numbers: the grain bowl credit was $21.60 and the lemonade's $1.00 share went to my account too, so $22.60 total? That's what I'm seeing you describe.\n\nAlso, I didn't know about the $55.49 hold, so I'm glad you flagged it. I'll keep an eye out for it dropping off my statement. Anything else I need to do on my end?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You've got it right: $21.60 for the grain bowl plus $1.00 for the lemonade's share of the discount makes **$22.60** in account credit. Separately, the **$3.00** refund is going to your Visa.\n\nYou don't need to do anything else:\n- The $22.60 credit will apply to your next order automatically.\n- The $3.00 refund should reach your card in 3\u20135 business days.\n- The $55.49 hold should drop off your statement on its own in 1\u20133 business days.\n\nIf the refund hasn't shown up after 5 business days, or the hold is still there after a few days, just message us. I'm sorry again about the missing grain bowl and lemonade, and enjoy your next Green Bowl order!"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, that all makes sense. I'll watch for the $3.00 on my Visa and the hold dropping off, and I'll message again if either one doesn't show up in the timeframe you gave. Appreciate the help, Grace is all set on this one."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You're welcome, Grace. Glad we got this sorted out. Have a great evening!"
